          "text": "@Support @nikitabier @elonmusk \nDear X Support Team,\n\nI am writing to respectfully request a human review of an account that belonged to my friend @AnIncandescence, who has since passed away.\n\nAfter the account was frozen, she experienced severe emotional distress. Sadly, she later died by suicide\n(https://t.co/UyhDHYmivy)\n(https://t.co/ZgG0YFiSF4)\nI understand that account enforcement decisions are made according to platform policies, but I don't believe the judge is fair enough. I am writing because this account now holds some of the last remaining traces of her life.\nThe account contains her writings, artwork, and personal expressions created during her lifetime. For those of us who knew her, these posts are not just social media content. They are part of her memory, her voice, and the record of her existence. Losing access to them has caused deep pain to the people who cared about her.\n\nI respectfully ask whether X could conduct a manual review of the suspension and consider restoring the account, or at minimum preserving and making accessible its contents in some appropriate way. If full restoration is not possible under policy, I would be grateful for any alternative you can offer for memorialization, access, or archival preservation.\n\nI understand this is a sensitive request, and I sincerely appreciate your time and consideration. If documentation is needed to verify her passing or the circumstances, I am willing to provide what is appropriate.\n\nThank you for your compassion and for taking the time to review this case.\n\nSincerely,\n\nWilf Lin(@WIlf_Lin)"
        },
